 **Data Structures:**
-The input is treated as a set of depth planes $P_0, P_1, \dots, P_{D-1}$, where each plane $P_i$ is a 2D grid of size $W \times H$. The output is a compacted set of planes $P'_0, P'_1, \dots, P'_{D'-1}$.
